Finance Books/

# Personal data & regenerable report artifacts — never tracked (2026-08-06 security review)
data/journal/my_portfolio.json
data/journal/reports/*.pdf
Emailed Reports/

# Scan artifacts (JP, 2026-09-04). Each scan is ~280 KB and two run every
# trading day, so committing them would add ~140 MB a year to a repo that
# already commits its journal twice daily. The audit trail that MATTERS is
# committed: every breadth entry and every book carries the scan_hash, so a
# claim can still be tied to the exact scan that produced it.
data/journal/scans/
data/journal/scan_latest.json
